                     <title>(endleaves to Titus A.xviii &amp; Vesp. B.x)</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Four leaves burnt at the edges and in part hard
                        to read. Formerly endleaves of Cotton Titus A.xviii &amp; Vesp. B.x. fols.
                        1--23, q. v.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Notes on fols. 37r etc. are probably by someone
                        connected with the cathedral of York.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Below the inscription on fol. 37v is a table of
                        contents in a Durham librarian's hand, s. xv ex.: "Tractatus de penitencia/
                        de vita Sancti Wilfiridi/ galfridus monam[...]/ dialogus [...]/ Vita sancti
                        brendani/ Vita longini militis".</note>
